      "id": 3302008,
      "name": "Because Tomorrow Still Comes",
      "desc": "A commemorative namecard obtained by increasing the Central Computing Hub repair progress in \"The Genius and the Miracle Chip!\"",
      "desc2": "\"Then... I suppose it's time for us to say goodbye.\"\n—\"What is goodbye?\"\n\"It's writing a long letter, filling it with all your memories and well wishes, and sending it toward tomorrow as you set off.\"\n—\"Then... we can also say — let's go!\"\n\nMay we always have an endless past to draw from, and a tomorrow vast enough to dream freely toward.",
